>>
Rule 18 (If A's dtype is complex, out should also be complex or float)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 10 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 11 then dtype_(v_2) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 11
>>
Rule 19 (If A's dtype is complex, out should also be complex or float. Otherwise out should be float)
