>>
Rule 26 (A must be a batches of square matrices (n, n) and if out is provided, the last dimension must be n)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) ∧ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2)-1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) -1)
>>
